!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: untreated
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = untreated or 0.2ug/ml doxorubicin for 6h
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = DMEM with 10% FCS, for ChIP-seq 4x106 cells were plated on 15 cm dish one day prior to treatment, for RNA-seq 1.5x 106 cells were plated on 10 cm dish
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For RNA-seq, total RNA was isolated using Trizol reagent, and mRNA was purified with the Dynabeads mRNA Purification Kit from Invitrogen.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For RNA-seq, libaries were prepared according to the 3-seq protocol: RNA was heat-sheared to fragments of 100-200 bp followed by first and second strand synthesis, linker ligation, size selection on agarose gel and PCR amplification for 15 cycles.
!Sample_data_processing = ChIP-seq and RNA-seq reads were aligned to the mm9 genome assembly using DNAnexus.
!Sample_data_processing = For ChIP-seq: Peaks were called using the DNAnexus ChIP-seq analyses tool with the following specifications: peak enrichment >20, peak-to background enrichment >3, a minimum ratio between uniquely and repetitively mapped reads of 3:1, a kernel bandwith of 30.0, FDR calculation enabled. Background was combined input  reads and reads from p53 ChIP in p53-/- MEFs.
!Sample_data_processing = For RNA-seq: Tag counts were derived using the DNAnexus 3SEQ transcriptome-based quantification tool with the following specifications: Sense only, RefSeq genes. The DESeq library was used to normalize tag counts between samples and to call differentially expressed genes.
